  "body": "\n### Discussed in https://github.com/zed-industries/zed/discussions/45962\n\n<div type='discussions-op-text'>\n\n<sup>Originally posted by **dangooddd** January  2, 2026</sup>\nIs zed plans to support remote development in regard of REPL and Devcontainers:\r\n1. Possibility to use REPL features on remote\r\n2. SSH -> Devcontainer, so Devcontainer is run on remote server\r\n\r\nThis two features are really essential for ML tasks, atleast my company uses this workflow, and I am limited to vscode when it comes to devcontainer on remote or running REPL on remote (often it is REPL in remote devcontainer).\r\n\r\nZed is really great, and I use it for personal stuff, but these two features are really blocking me and potentially many other ML engineers from switching editor from VSCode to Zed.\r\n\r\nHappy New Year!</div>",
